			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with fleet-wide updates\n\nSynchronize the Element submodule to 220904a6, bringing in downstream updates across multiple Element components:\n- Mountain (db5f0f7): Rename binary/library targets to \"Mountain\", simplify tauri.conf.json identifiers\n- Sky (d574527): Fix 0-based line indexing bug in search results RangeLocations causing 'undefined' errors, add Mountain.dev.log diagnostic bridging\n- Maintain (0d1cee9): Rebuild CHANGELOG with quarter-based versioning, add v1.3 and v1.0 sections\n- Worker (0e2d546): Expand CHANGELOG from 61 to 134 lines documenting complete version history v2.1→v0.0\n- Echo (1f3c848): Bump miniflare and wrangler dev dependencies\n- Cocoon (01322bf): Submodule sync bringing search functionality fix and documentation improvements\n\nThis aligns with the ongoing CHANGELOG format migration and maintenance synchronization across the Element umbrella.",
